        "description": "ECS Exec is enabled but audit logging is not configured. Exec sessions — including credential access — are not recorded.",
        "action": "Configure ECS Exec audit logging to CloudWatch Logs or S3. Enable session logging in the cluster Execute Command configuration.",
        "example": "{\n  \"container\": {\n    \"kind\": \"ecs_service\",\n    \"exec\": {\n      \"audit_logging_enabled\": true\n    }\n  }\n}\n"
      },
